R. Simon in the names of Yochanan and Yehoshua ben Levi. It does not date Yehudah’s meeting to R. Yehoshua’s lifetime. Preserve Heilprin’s chronological doubt.","evidence":[{"reference":"Jerusalem Talmud Moed Katan 3:5:28","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Jerusalem_Talmud_Moed_Katan_3.5.28"},"witness":"The Jerusalem Talmud, edition by Heinrich W. Guggenheimer. Berlin, De Gruyter, 1999-2015"}]},{"id":"1697:1:citation-05","he":[312,331],"en":[519,549],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pesikta_Rabbati_1.1"},"reference":"Pesikta Rabbati 1:1","assessment":"Pesikta Rabbati explicitly transmits in R. Yehudah bar Siman’s name, with a monetary exception for Abraham’s purchase at Hebron.","evidence":[{"reference":"Pesikta Rabbati 1:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Pesikta_Rabbati_1.1"},"witness":"OYW"}]},{"id":"1697:1:citation-06","he":[352,364],"en":[570,591],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_53.8"},"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 53:8","assessment":"Bereshit Rabbah gives Berekhiah son of R. Yehudah son of R. Simon in the transmission from Shmuel bar Yitzchak.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 53:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_53.8"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 818:1","target":{"entry":818,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]},{"id":"1697:1:citation-07","he":[403,425],"en":[648,683],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_84.18"},"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 84:18","assessment":"The directly checked Genesis Rabbah has Yehoshua ben Baytus transmitting from Yehudah bar Simon, on Joseph’s sale. Preserve Heilprin’s spelling of Beitim and note this witness.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 84:18","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_84.18"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 1785:1","target":{"entry":1785,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]},{"id"