ness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Eikhah Rabbah 1:36","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eikhah_Rabbah_1.36"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Eikhah Rabbah 1:38","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eikhah_Rabbah_1.38"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]},{"id":"1697:1:citation-11","he":[505,526],"en":[989,1027],"target":{"url":"https://rabenu.app/books/yalkut-shimoni/devarim/reeh/clean/"},"reference":"Yalkut Shimoni, Reeh 897","assessment":"Yalkut Shimoni, Reeh 897, gives Lulinus the Southerner from R. Yehudah bar Siman on the duty to include four vulnerable groups in festival rejoicing.","evidence":[{"reference":"Yalkut Shimoni, Reeh 897","target":{"url":"https://rabenu.app/books/yalkut-shimoni/devarim/reeh/clean/"},"witness":"Rabenu digital transcription of Yalkut Shimoni"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 2365:1","target":{"entry":2365,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]},{"id":"1697:1:citation-12","he":[541,554],"en":[1051,1074],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eikhah_Rabbah_2.6"},"reference":"Eikhah Rabbah 2:6","assessment":"Eikhah Rabbah 2:6 directly has R. Azaryah transmit in Yehudah’s name on the binding of Israel’s warriors’ hands.","evidence":[{"reference":"Eikhah Rabbah 2:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Eikhah_Rabbah_2.6"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]},{"id":"1697:1:citation-13","he":[556,580],"en":[1076,1113],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bamidbar_Rabbah_12.3"},"reference":"Bamidbar Rabbah 12:3","assessment":"Numbers Rabbah gives Prozdaq bar Nachsha transmitting in Yehudah bar Simon’s name on the shadow of the Tabernacle. The related Heilprin entry explicitly reports Yehoshua as a variant.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bamidbar Rabbah 12:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bamidbar_Rabbah_12.3"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 3005:1","target":{"entry":3005,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]},{"id":"1697:1:citation-14","he":[582,614],"en":[1165,1179],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Kamma_47b.19"},"reference":"Bava Kamma 47b:19","assessment":"The checked Bavli explicitly names Rav Yehudah bar Simon as the teacher of the quoted Karna Nezikin baraita. Restore the active voice and named subject under the received heading.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bava Kamma 47b:19","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bava_Kamma_47b.19"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1697:1:citation-15","he":[366,380],"en":[1298,1349],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shir_HaShirim_Rabbah_2.14.8"},"reference":"Shir HaShirim Rabbah 2:14:8","assessment":"Both names occur in Shir HaShirim Rabbah in consecutive explanations of the matriarchs’ barrenness. That adjacency does not date them; the chronology remains held.","evidence":[{"reference":"Shir HaShirim Rabbah 2:14:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shir_HaShirim_Rabbah_2.14.8"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[3,0,4,5,14,6,7,8,9,10,11,12,13],"holds":[{"raw":"בזמן ריב\"ל (לא ידעתי מנ\"ל)","reason":"The passage juxtaposes received traditions but does not date Yehudah’s encounter. Preserve the compiler’s explicit doubt.","evidence":[{"reference":"Jerusalem Talmud Moed Katan 3:5:28","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Jerusalem_Talmud_Moed_Katan_3.5.28"},"witness":"The Jerusalem Talmud, edition by Heinrich W. Guggenheimer. Berlin, De Gruyter, 1999-2015"}]},{"raw":"וברכה שם בסמוך","reason":"The exact VeZot HaBerakhah passage is still unidentified in the checked edition. Keep the inherited locator.","evidence":[{"reference":"Devarim Rabbah 1:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Devarim_Rabbah_1.2"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Devarim Rabbah 1:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Devarim_Rabbah_1.6"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Devarim Rabbah 4:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Devarim_Rabbah_4.4"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Devarim Rabbah 7:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Devarim_Rabbah_7.1"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Devarim Rabbah 7:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Devarim_Rabbah_7.2"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Devarim Rabbah 7:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Devarim_Rabbah_7.5"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]},{"raw":"ר' חוניא בזמנו","reason":"The Midrash’s juxtaposition of expositions does not establish contemporaneity.","evidence":[{"reference":"Shir HaShirim Rabbah 2:14:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shir_HaShirim_Rabbah_2.14.8"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]},{"raw":"בש\"ר יהודה בר אלעאי","reason":"The internal repetition does not supply direct confirmation. The inspected Genesis Rabbah chain gives distinct names.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 1649:8","target":{"entry":1649,"paragraph":8},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 42:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_42.8"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]},{"raw":"בש\"ר לוי תנחומא ס\"פ משפטים","reason":"The cited locus gives bar Shalom. A Tanchuma witness reading bar Simon in this chain has yet to be located.","evidence":[{"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma, Mishpatim:19:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma%2C_Mishpatim.19.5"},"witness":"Midrash Tanchuma -- Torat Emet"},{"reference":"Midrash Tanchuma Buber, Mishpatim:10:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Midrash_Tanchuma_Buber%2C_Mishpatim.10.1"},"witness":"Midrash Tanhuma haKadum veHaYashan, S. Buber, 1885"},{"reference":"Devarim Rabbah 1:6","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Devarim_Rabbah_1.6"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]},{"raw":"בש\"ר נהוראי","reason":"Independent confirmation is open for the single-name attribution. Keep separate from Yosi ben Nehorai.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 2601:1","target":{"entry":2